 "kind": "recipe",
 "metadata": {
  "alignment": "standard",
  "description": "tonyd2wild's regular Inkling Small profile on two Sparks: thinkingmachines/Inkling-Small-NVFP4 on vLLM tensor parallel 2 (mp, as eugr's launcher does by default) with Inkling's native one-token MTP drafter, InstantTensor loading, a 262,144-token context, BF16 KV cache (upstream: FP8 and NVFP4 KV are hardware-capable but the Inkling relative-attention kernel cannot consume them yet) and CUDA graphs. Image: eugr's published spark-vllm image (digest-pinned, built from eugr/spark-vllm-docker 60dee5b4), with upstream's mods applied at build time: eugr's inkling-sm12-paged-kv (vendored FA4 SM120 kernel) and instanttensor-hybrid-draft-loader, and tonyd2wild's inkling-agent-parser-fix (filters a leaked terminal end-of-message marker after tool results). Same-creator alternative for this model and Spark count: the DSpark recipe with the RadixArk draft. Licences (information only): model Apache-2.0; eugr's runtime and mods MIT with a bundled FA4 package under its own licence; tonyd2wild's repository states that no licence has been selected. Upstream measurements are in its results document and are claims until measured here; Vonk physical two-Spark acceptance is pending.",
  "tags": [
   "distributed",
   "inkling",
   "instanttensor",
   "mtp",
   "multimodal",
   "nvfp4",
   "reasoning",
   "spark",
   "tool-use",
   "vllm"
  ],
  "title": "Inkling Small NVFP4 MTP vLLM two Sparks (tonyd2wild)"
 },
